@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@lottery = uk-lotto
@mutationApiKey = replace-with-your-local-mutation-key

### Cheap status; also supports euromillions and set-for-life
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/status
X-Lottery: {{lottery}}

### Recalculate with the default evaluation window
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/recalculate
X-Lottery: {{lottery}}
X-Api-Key: {{mutationApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"useAllHistory": false}

### Recalculate with every available draw after warmup
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/analysis/recalculate
X-Lottery: {{lottery}}
X-Api-Key: {{mutationApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"useAllHistory": true}

### Before recalculation, or after a result changes: expect 409, never an automatic backtest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/predictions/generate
X-Lottery: {{lottery}}
X-Api-Key: {{mutationApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
